 "title": "节点被蒙住眼",
 "pill": 3,
 "total": 114.96,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "前面是你问节点，节点答错。",
   "spoken": "前面是你问节点，节点答错。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.024,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 3.781
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "另一种情况，是节点自己看到的网络，被人操纵。",
   "spoken": "另一种情况，是节点自己看到的网络，被人操纵。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.844,
   "dur": 5.16,
   "speechStart": 4.942,
   "speechEnd": 9.156
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "节点之间直接交换区块和交易，这叫 P2P 网络。",
   "spoken": "节点之间直接交换区块和交易，这叫 P2P 网络。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-02.mp3",
   "start": 10.224,
   "dur": 5.064,
   "speechStart": 10.322,
   "speechEnd": 14.441
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "日蚀攻击，是攻击者占满受害节点的全部对等连接。",
   "spoken": "日蚀攻击，是攻击者占满受害节点的全部对等连接。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-03.mp3",
   "start": 15.508,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 15.606,
   "speechEnd": 19.713
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "节点只看到攻击者给的区块和交易。",
   "spoken": "节点只看到攻击者给的区块和交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-04.mp3",
   "start": 20.768,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 20.866,
   "speechEnd": 23.52
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "最关键的一步，在节点重启。",
   "spoken": "最关键的一步，在节点虫启。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-05.mp3",
   "start": 24.588,
   "dur": 3.192,
   "speechStart": 24.686,
   "speechEnd": 26.936
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "重启时，节点会从地址表里挑选对等节点。",
   "spoken": "虫启时，节点会从地址表里挑选对等节点。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-06.mp3",
   "start": 28.0,
   "dur": 4.632,
   "speechStart": 28.098,
   "speechEnd": 31.8
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "地址表如果已经被攻击者填满，它连上的就全是攻击者。",
   "spoken": "地址表如果已经被攻击者填满，它连上的就全是攻击者。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-07.mp3",
   "start": 32.852,
   "dur": 5.64,
   "speechStart": 32.95,
   "speechEnd": 37.652
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "2018 年的一篇论文显示，两台主机、各一个 IP，就能日蚀一个以太坊节点。",
   "spoken": "2018 年的一篇论文显示，两台主机、各一个 IP，就能日蚀一个以太坊节点。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-08.mp3",
   "start": 38.712,
   "dur": 6.96,
   "speechStart": 38.81,
   "speechEnd": 44.833
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "Geth 1.8.0 随后限制了同一网段的节点数。",
   "spoken": "Geth 1.8.0 随后限制了同一网段的节点数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-09.mp3",
   "start": 45.892,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 45.99,
   "speechEnd": 49.371
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-10",
   "text": "比特币加了锚点连接，重启时优先恢复上次的出站连接。",
   "spoken": "比特币加了锚点连接，虫启时优先恢复上次的出站连接。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-10.mp3",
   "start": 50.432,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 50.53,
   "speechEnd": 54.875
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-11",
   "text": "被日蚀的节点，同步状态看起来正常。",
   "spoken": "被日蚀的节点，同步状态看起来正常。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-11.mp3",
   "start": 55.932,
   "dur": 3.888,
   "speechStart": 56.03,
   "speechEnd": 58.982
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-12",
   "text": "它有连接，也有新块，只是落后，或者在错误的分支上。",
   "spoken": "它有连接，也有新块，只是落后，或者在错误的分支上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-12.mp3",
   "start": 60.04,
   "dur": 5.328,
   "speechStart": 60.138,
   "speechEnd": 64.53
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-13",
   "text": "对等节点数只说明有连接，不说明连接来自独立的运营方。",
   "spoken": "对等节点数只说明有连接，不说明连接来自独立的运营方。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-13.mp3",
   "start": 65.588,
   "dur": 5.424,
   "speechStart": 65.686,
   "speechEnd": 70.174
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-14",
   "text": "节点崩溃，也可能是攻击的第一步。",
   "spoken": "节点崩溃，也可能是攻击的第一步。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-14.mp3",
   "start": 71.232,
   "dur": 3.432,
   "speechStart": 71.33,
   "speechEnd": 73.83
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-15",
   "text": "切换逻辑如果把流量转到不可信的备用节点，DoS 就成了数据污染的前置步骤。",
   "spoken": "切换逻辑如果把流量转到不可信的备用节点，DoS 就成了数据污染的前置步骤。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-15.mp3",
   "start": 74.884,
   "dur": 6.744,
   "speechStart": 74.982,
   "speechEnd": 80.779
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-16",
   "text": "开头的事件正是这样。",
   "spoken": "开头的事件正是这样。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-16.mp3",
   "start": 81.848,
   "dur": 2.4,
   "speechStart": 81.946,
   "speechEnd": 83.41
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-17",
   "text": "另一类事故，来自节点自己的配置。",
   "spoken": "另一类事故，来自节点自己的配置。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-17.mp3",
   "start": 84.468,
   "dur": 3.336,
   "speechStart": 84.566,
   "speechEnd": 86.97
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-18",
   "text": "2018 年，一个团伙扫描暴露 JSON-RPC 的以太坊节点，盗走约 3.8 万个 ETH。",
   "spoken": "2018 年，一个团伙扫描暴露 JSON-RPC 的以太坊节点，盗走约 3.8 万个 ETH。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-18.mp3",
   "start": 88.024,
   "dur": 7.704,
   "speechStart": 88.122,
   "speechEnd": 94.895
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-19",
   "text": "Geth 默认只监听本机，接口是运营者自己打开的。",
   "spoken": "Geth 默认只监听本机，接口是运营者自己打开的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-19.mp3",
   "start": 95.948,
   "dur": 4.608,
   "speechStart": 96.046,
   "speechEnd": 99.724
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-20",
   "text": "RPC 接口只绑内网或本机，对外必须经过认证网关。",
   "spoken": "RPC 接口只绑内网或本机，对外必须经过认证网关。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep17/audio/lines/seg3-20.mp3",
   "start": 100.776,
   "dur": 5.352,
   "speechStart": 100.874,
   "speechEnd": 105.29
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-21",
   "text": "给执行客户端下指令的 Engine API，只对共识客户端开放，并用 JWT 认证。",
   "spoken": "给执行客户端下指令的 Engine API，只对共识客户端开放，并用 JWT 认证。",
